state.description:
`unratified` — live, flagged, awaiting another administrator;
`pending` — unratified and not yet in effect (a policy delay);
`ratified` — an ordinary grant now, kept here as history.

origin.description:
`recorded` — a `git-ns/*` record, governed by the rights model;
`roleDerived` — a v0.1 `[hooks.git-trust] grant_on_role` grant,
published by the hook relay and managed only through configuration.
